{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"wait","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"awaitedState"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"State","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The state to wait for.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"awaitedState"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the state machine got to the state. It is false if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state machine can no longer get there, or the task was cancelled."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It returns at once if the state machine is already at the state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise it waits for a transition leading to the state. A state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entered and left again before the waiting task runs still counts,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so read "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" to know where the state machine is by then."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The waiting ends without the state being reached when the state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"machine gets to a state from which the state can no longer be reached,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like an ending state, and when the task waiting is cancelled."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like a stream, it only knows the transitions made after it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"called. A state entered and left again before the call is missed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which can happen when it is called from a new task, as the task can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"start running after the events were processed. A state the state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"machine stays at, like an ending state, is never missed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["Task {","    if await stateMachine.wait(for: .delivered) {","        print(\"Delivered\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A task waiting keeps the state machine. For a state machine without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ending states, cancel the task when the state is no longer of interest."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/wait(for:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/wait(for:)"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MiamiStateMachine"}],"externalID":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C4wait3forSbq__tYaF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"wait(for:)","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"wait","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Waits until the state machine is at a state."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine"]]},"references":{"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateMachine"}],"type":"topic","title":"StateMachine","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateMachine"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A state machine is an actor with a current state and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a set of transitions defining the machine. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"TransitionRule","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connects two states by an event trigger."}]},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/wait(for:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/wait(for:)","title":"wait(for:)","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/wait(for:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Waits until the state machine is at a state."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"wait"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}]},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","title":"MiamiStateMachine","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine","type":"topic","abstract":[]}}}